# package-lock.json is tracked (GitHub issue #51): `^1.62.1` alone let every install
# resolve a different Playwright and Chromium, and the pixel and axis checks moved with it.

# Screenshots are real account data and this repo is public. The scripts write them
# next to themselves, so this must stay. Videos, traces and HAR captures record the
# same UI (and the API responses behind it), so they are covered too.
